+|---|---|---|
+| REQ-LEARN-4119 | Proposed (python/carnot/experiment_4119_carnot_verifier_graft_sudoku.py, Exp 4119) | Proposed (tests/python/test_experiment_4119_carnot_verifier_graft_sudoku.py) |
